{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>11 月 26 日是大埔宏福苑大火一周年，《聚焦一周》從不同的角度，回顧宏福苑的人和事。<br/><br/>阿妙綜合幾位死難者家屬，在失去至親之後一年的感受，細說他們是如何與傷痛同行。宏福苑有 13 戶拒在限期前賣業權予政府，阿妙訪問了其中一名業主何小姐，了解她為何堅持信念？以及在過去一年，因敢於發聲要承受的壓力。<br/><br/>《集誌社》亦訪問了最後一批參加特設銷售計劃揀樓的宏福苑業主，談談告別宏福苑的感受；以及在過去一年，一直跟進宏福苑情況的前區議員姚鈞豪，了解宏福苑大火一年，還有多少仍未解決的問題。<br/><br/>相關報道：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cIBdutWuU-4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">影像記錄｜宏福苑大火一年　父親的印記</a><a href=\"https://youtu.be/KC8q08AmyM0?si=SaQe87LXemjGxVtn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><br/>影像記錄．宏福苑大火一年｜帶蛋糕與太陽花上山 爸爸：慢慢等，一定會再見</a><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/2ntW5Xvbq-Q?si=gjef0e_gsFVG0SuV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">影像記錄｜宏福苑大火一年　IT’S OK TO BE NOT OK !</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:58.511085+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:50:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T18:28:37.875276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.461254+00:00","content_hash":"5e4a5ce2bc7593df3439c09ce0c6a84055bb6617373012a90ef0820ab19e9889","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}